---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Eric Qiu's photos." path="/about/">
  <section class="prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Where I put the photos.</h1>
    <p>
      I'm <a href="https://ericqiu.dev" rel="me">Eric Qiu</a>. I take photos when I travel, and on walks the rest of the time. The ones I like end up here.
    </p>
    <p>
      The home page is a few favorites; the archive is everything. Places and series sort the same photos by where and by what.
    </p>
    <p>
      Photos sit on the SD card a while before I get to them — sometimes years.
    </p>
    <p>
      For software, writing, or to get in touch, there's <a href="https://ericqiu.dev">ericqiu.dev</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
